  "structure": {
    "block_count": 34,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Is Your Child Ready for Preschool?",
        "text_sha256": "eeb77a5825615ce65c22f95f457e4239b24d431ac34cb3c4f181c0c23b97c701",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "preschool",
        "text_sha256": "9c0df375f7d5a19e4158902e86c043b4e04321d58a6f392e89c670f5600a23ba",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Ready, set…go? Take our quiz to find out if the timing is right for your tot to start preschool.",
        "text_sha256": "484cdc4c8d5f29225a65d28f604d567ae38c4f1e37e9822ca14fbb6e8bab356d",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "How can you predict whether it's time to load up your little one's backpack and pack him off to preschool? Skip the Magic 8 Balls and Ouija boards, and look no further than your child to clue you in. What your potential preschooler will be expected to know and be able to do before he's signed up will depend on the school you're considering as well as his age (preschool can start as early as age 2, or as late as age 4). But there are some general indications of readiness that can help you decide if preschool should be in your child's near future.",
        "text_sha256": "24d75fdca6f87106b939341ceab7b73c3d345e0fcf4d78f96bcabc09470f5418",
        "word_count": 105
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Grab a sheet of paper and a pen and take our yes-or-no quiz to find out if your tot has what it takes to make the grade — and pick up tips for upping his chances of preschool success.",
        "text_sha256": "afca8a25392df73314da60db1855d458852333ee399494ccfcf35547d509e1b8",
        "word_count": 39
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Does your child know how to understand and follow simple directions? ∗Yes ∗No",
        "text_sha256": "07cd59b024d765888f5f7e57fdf143d80451c84587b2a530c00a45d1adf81d19",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Is your child able to cooperate and take turns? ∗Yes ∗No",
        "text_sha256": "a729c4636a17b2f916c314c8b988b0ff9fb4a268b85fe0953921850578926035",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Is your child potty-trained? ∗Yes ∗No",
        "text_sha256": "aff228e084904cbc2bf8382d9f94b88f5a5e6f9fb6e1dd8a201bad407c65cd44",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Does your child know how to understand and follow simple directions? ∗Yes ∗No",
        "text_sha256": "07cd59b024d765888f5f7e57fdf143d80451c84587b2a530c00a45d1adf81d19",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Is your child comfortable around other adults and kids? ∗Yes ∗No",
        "text_sha256": "0f78ffeb3ac6394f786968da696b5db9d1667204a6da658d22e767be49b678a9",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Does your child know how to make decisions? ∗Yes ∗No",
        "text_sha256": "ed8106142b7d6d517c221012d62862ee93913f0db7b07e1e6caec27a048d3168",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Is your child used to a structured schedule? ∗Yes ∗No",
        "text_sha256": "82526adad76451f6ac5b74118cd410db5f44ebee4c5e9458e7d1adf6371093d8",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Does your child have basic self-care skills, such as using zippers and buttons, washing hands and eating lunch or a snack without help from you? ∗Yes ∗No",
        "text_sha256": "9ad5507fc05687b1828c29f60d0357122f4dcccac4eb357e82cac500b7567ba2",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Finished? Then check out the answers to find out if your child is ready for school.",
        "text_sha256": "b7df40b917f11a89262e5c57fa7f21467169f8556d790b7c6722c43d84bc21bb",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "blockquote",
        "tag": "blockquote",
        "text": "Zero to Three, Preschool Prep: How to Prepare Your Toddler for Preschool , February 2010. American Academy of Pediatrics, Healthychildren.org, Is Your Child Ready for School? November 2009. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, CDC’s Developmental Milestones , June 2018. Children’s Hospital of Orange County, Developmental Milestones: Dressing Skills . What to Expect the Second Year , Heidi Murkoff and Sharon Mazel. Whattoexpect.com, Tips on Starting Potty Training , June 2018.",
        "text_sha256": "4713ba8c5e3fcc47098e79c6753e7989e0ed08b8ac2e3c0460c0b3e24d0234d3",
        "word_count": 71
